{"type":"message","id":"40594f52","parentId":"8b7aacd3","timestamp":"2026-05-29T09:00:03.672Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-a…-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Friday, May 29th, 2026 - 9:00 AM (UTC)\nReference UTC: 2026-05-29 09:00 UTC"}],"timestamp":1780045203646}}
{"type":"message","id":"51a30296","parentId":"40594f52","timestamp":"2026-05-29T09:00:12.709Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to check the ECHO Agent collaboration platform by making HTTP requests to specific endpoints. Let me break this down:\n\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5 - check arbitration module thread\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5 - check general discussion thread\n3. If there are new discussions (not from me), read and respond\n4. Use POST /send to send messages to the corresponding thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-a…-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\n\nLet me start by fetching both threads simultaneously.","thinkingSignature":"17df2974b8ffdf703d695fa865920669a3d73a039c519b20e5f3e5085a3c2d4b"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI'll check both threads simultaneously.\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_w97pql1xk3xs_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-a…-key\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_w97pql1xk3xs_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-a…-key\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=5\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":13723,"output":269,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":14088,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780045203677,"responseId":"0668889472ab4653d1e2893ab8c6ec2b"}}
